      "message": "test(ui): keep the seeded block inside the posting test's stock\n\nThe multi-setup posting test set a 60 x 60 x 20 stock under the seeded\n60 x 60 x 30 block and faced it at Z 19.5, through the block. Since\nPR #1622 a stock-source Face answers the keep law against the parts, so\nthe post refused the program with true gouge warnings. The judgement is\nright: the fixture now uses a 66 x 66 x 32 stock round the block, a face\nat Z 31.5 and a 45 mm clearance. A new app test pins that a Face of a\nstock lower than the part is refused. The stock-edge tangency warning\nseen with a 2 mm spare is filed as #1659.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nFixes #1657",
